  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Drain sweetcorn. Roughly chop tomato.\n• In a small bowl, combine corn and tomato. Add a drizzle of the white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season to taste and toss.\n• Finely chop or crush garlic. Drain and rinse kidney beans.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6323f102322d61479204e155/step-ac74493b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Slice tortillas into wedges and place on the lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle or spray generously with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat and spread out evenly.\n• Bake until lightly golden, 8-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6323f102322d61479204e155/step-89db88c7.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook kidney beans until just softened, 2-3 mins.\n• Stir in butter, garlic, tomato paste and BBQ spice blend and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Stir in baby spinach and the water. Simmer for 2 mins. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6323f102322d61479204e155/step-8def3c30.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide tortilla chips between plates.\n• Top with bean mixture and cheese. Serve with corn salsa.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6323f102322d61479204e155/step-23beee6c.jpg"
    }
  ]
